// prop_lab: fetched from TradingView 2026-10-08
// url: https://www.tradingview.com/script/MN4tJCT5-Liquidity-Sweep-Breakout-LSB/
// id: PUB;1d0671e157b741d5a0a6dc1eb8652d77  kind: strategy  likes: 764
